# Automatic Benches
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Automatic_Press.name=Automatic Rune Press
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Automatic_Press.description=Used to shape raw materials into empty runes.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Automatic_Imbuer.name=Automatic Imbuer
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Automatic_Imbuer.description=Used to imbue empty runes with elemental essence.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Mana_Liquifier.name=Mana Liquifier
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Mana_Liquifier.description=Used to convert elemental essences into liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color> using fuel.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#00D4D5">fluid output</color>.

# Automatic Vanilla Benches
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Bench_Alchemy.name=Automated Alchemy Bench
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Bench_Alchemy.description=Used to create potions and elixirs.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.\n\n<i>The alchemists of old long sought the secrets to eternal life. Some might say they achieved that grand goal, though perhaps not in the form they imagined.</i>
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Bench_Arcane.name=Automated Arcane Bench
items.Glyphworks_Crafting_Bench_Arcane.description=Used to fashion various arcane implements.\nAutomatically pulls <color is="#47D500">input</color> and pushes <color is="#FF0000">output</color>.\nRequires liquid <color is="#35c1f1">mana</color>.\n\n<i>The arcane arts are the closest mere mortals have ever come to achieving Avatar powers. Had they mastered them sooner, perhaps they would not have been so easily swayed.</i>
